 "note": "TEST_EXISTING v4 target (public-test-case-existing-v4): 15 exported functions from 14 permissive repos outside lm-corpus (repo and module sha checked against ext-manifest 8458eac6 + ext-corpus.json), each called by an existing test file at the pinned commit (HEAD of the clone), where v1, v2 and v3 refuse the function (test_target_signature) and v4 accepts it on the pinned module text, following relative imports only through the pinned sibling fixtures (3 examples need a sibling). The examples cover the v4 widenings: optional parameters, literal and typed defaults, Record, Partial, Pick and Omit references and Array<...> returns. Method: the HEAD scan of the same 411 + 326 cloned permissive TypeScript repos used for M88 found 205 candidates (at most 3 per repo); 15 were picked by hand for spread over the widenings and repos, all 15 replayed and passed the license, size, email and corpus-sha checks. Peace's public repos were checked first (see peace): both have fitting functions, but both repos are in the corpus manifest, so they are recorded and not counted.",
